    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30975" root="عور" body-key="E">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عاورهُ الشَّىْءَ</span></b>  <i>He did with the thing like as he</i>
(the other) <i>did with it:</i> (S:) [or <i>he did the thing
with him by turns;</i> for] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُعَاوَرَةُ</span> is similar to
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُدَاوَلَةُ</span>, with respect to a thing that is between
two, or mutual. (TA. [See also 6.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also 4. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عاور المَكَايِيلَ</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَايَرَهَا</span>; [q. v. in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عير</span>;] (S, O, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عوّرها</span></b> . (K.)

